<title>USA: Owosso Corp names John Reese chairman.</title>
<headline>Owosso Corp names John Reese chairman.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owosso Corp said Thursday it had elected John Reese as chairman of the board, suceeding George Lemmon, who retired.</p>
<p>Reese was formerly vice chairman, the company said.</p>
